    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "2. Heard Mr. Abhishek Kulkarni, learned counsel for the applicant and Smt. Mhatre, learned APP for the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 734,
      "end": 843,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Abhishek Kulkarni",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 747,
          "end": 764
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhatre",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 809,
          "end": 815
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. The F.I.R. is lodged by one Bharatkumar Patel.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 844,
      "end": 894,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bharatkumar Patel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 876,
          "end": 893
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "He has stated that, he has a family consisting of his two sons, daughters in law and grand children.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 895,
      "end": 995,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03150312602519989
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The informant is a hawker and is earning Digitally signed by VINOD VINOD BHASKAR BHASKAR GOKHALE GOKHALE Date:\n2024.04.16 14:49:02 +0530 2 of 8 3-aba-993-24 his livelihood by selling clothes at Colaba.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 996,
      "end": 1197,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "VINOD VINOD BHASKAR BHASKAR GOKHALE GOKHALE",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1057,
          "end": 1100
        },
        {
          "text": "2024.04.16",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1107,
          "end": 1117
        },
        {
          "text": "Colaba",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1190,
          "end": 1196
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.026122232899069786
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Since his family had many members, he decided to purchase a flat in the year 2015.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1198,
      "end": 1280,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08727250248193741
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Clarence Anthony Pereira vs The State Of Maharashtra on 15 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/135909457/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1281,
      "end": 1409,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Clarence Anthony Pereira vs The State Of Maharashtra",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1282,
          "end": 1334
        },
        {
          "text": "15 April, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1338,
          "end": 1352
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Accordingly, he purchased Flat No.502, 'B' Wing, 5th floor, Gopeshwar Apartment, Chakala,\nAndheri (E).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1410,
      "end": 1512,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Chakala",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1491,
          "end": 1498
        },
        {
          "text": "Andheri",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1500,
          "end": 1507
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0496036522090435
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The construction was completed and he got the possession in the year 2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1513,
      "end": 1587,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08373061567544937
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Initially,\nhe gave that flat on rent to one Arora; who vacated it on 05.02.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1588,
      "end": 1668,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Arora",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1632,
          "end": 1637
        },
        {
          "text": "05.02.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1657,
          "end": 1667
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06316360086202621
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Thereafter, since the informant was in need of money, he decided to give that flat on rent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1669,
      "end": 1760,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08061131834983826
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The person who was looking after the building namely Abbas told this to an Estate Agent Chandrakant Kharat; who brought one Rafel.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1761,
      "end": 1891,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Abbas",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1814,
          "end": 1819
        },
        {
          "text": "Chandrakant Kharat",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1849,
          "end": 1867
        },
        {
          "text": "Rafel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1885,
          "end": 1890
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0385676845908165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The first informant and Rafel prepared the leave and licence agreement on 11.02.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1893,
      "end": 1978,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rafel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1917,
          "end": 1922
        },
        {
          "text": "11.02.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1967,
          "end": 1977
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09690595418214798
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The rent was fixed at Rs.35000/- per month and the deposit was fixed at Rs.1 lakh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1979,
      "end": 2061,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08170560002326965
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Rafel had paid Rs.50000/-\nonline.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2062,
      "end": 2095,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rafel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2062,
          "end": 2067
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06768781691789627
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The informant was in financial difficulty and, therefore, he decided to sell that flat in March 2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2096,
      "end": 2197,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09497799724340439
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "He had sent a prospective purchaser to have a look at that flat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2198,
      "end": 2262,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07396446913480759
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "At that time, the present applicant who is Rafel's father and the applicant's daughter Rachel fought with that prospective purchaser and drove him away.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2263,
      "end": 2415,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rafel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2306,
          "end": 2311
        },
        {
          "text": "Rachel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2350,
          "end": 2356
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06739024817943573
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The applicant was not allowing anybody to see that flat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2416,
      "end": 2472,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0985122099518776
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "They used to 3 of 8 3-aba-993-24 tell the prospective purchasers that, they themselves had purchased that flat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2473,
      "end": 2584,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "3-aba-993-24",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2493,
          "end": 2505
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07104748487472534
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "When the informant questioned them, they suggested to him that the informant should sell that flat to the applicant and his family.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2585,
      "end": 2717,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04345183074474335
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "There are allegations that the applicant's family had put some new furniture and had changed the fans.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2718,
      "end": 2820,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07657451927661896
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "It is alleged that the applicant, Rafel and Rachel told him that they could purchase his flat for Rs.1,44,00,000/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2821,
      "end": 2936,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rafel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2855,
          "end": 2860
        },
        {
          "text": "Rachel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2865,
          "end": 2871
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0535164475440979
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "The informant told them that they should pay some earnest money and should prepare an MoU.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2937,
      "end": 3027,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09677404165267944
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "On 23.04.2023, the applicant sent a photograph of a cheque issued on the State Bank of India, bearing No.143665 for Rs.10 lakhs through WhatsApp, but he did not handover the cheque to the informant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3028,
      "end": 3226,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "23.04.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3031,
          "end": 3041
        },
        {
          "text": "State Bank of India",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3101,
          "end": 3120
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1651284545660019
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "They did not even pay the rent of that flat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3227,
      "end": 3271,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16749325394630432
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "4. On 10.08.2023, the informant gave a notice to Rafel for vacating that flat, but the flat was not vacated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3273,
      "end": 3381,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "10.08.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3279,
          "end": 3289
        },
        {
          "text": "Rafel",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3322,
          "end": 3327
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1589203178882599
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "The applicant prepared a forged MoU and an affidavit.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3382,
      "end": 3435,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20273591578006744
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Those documents were notarised.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3436,
      "end": 3467,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19017788767814636
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "They were using those documents to claim their ownership.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3468,
      "end": 3526,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1863197237253189
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "On 10.10.2023, when the informant and his daughter in law had gone to the flat to request the applicant to vacate the 4 of 8 3-aba-993-24 flat, they were abused and threatened.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3527,
      "end": 3703,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "10.10.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3530,
          "end": 3540
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1943645477294922
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "The informant gave a complaint to Andheri police station.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3704,
      "end": 3761,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Andheri police station",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3738,
          "end": 3760
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19598212838172913
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "During enquiry, he came to know that the applicant had filed a Civil Suit in the Court at Dindoshi.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3762,
      "end": 3862,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Court at Dindoshi",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 3844,
          "end": 3861
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21547821164131165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "On this basis the F.I.R. was lodged.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3863,
      "end": 3900,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1754097044467926
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that the informant had received Rs.45 lakhs in cash in installments from the applicant and that he had executed a receipt to that effect.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3902,
      "end": 4086,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16702218353748322
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "A copy of that receipt is at page No.42 of memo of this application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4087,
      "end": 4155,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.03614116460084915
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "He submitted that, an MoU was executed between the parties on 22.03.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4156,
      "end": 4229,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "22.03.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4218,
          "end": 4228
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22188372910022736
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "It bears the informant's signature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4230,
      "end": 4265,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09655680507421494
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "It is a Notarised document and it is accompanied by a possession letter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4266,
      "end": 4338,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19423513114452362
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "He submitted that, the leave and licence agreement was executed on 11.02.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4339,
      "end": 4417,
      "entities": [
        {
